<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 10.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to London Jul 125.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Yorkshire Jul 84.00</p>
<p>East Devon Jul 84.00</p>
<p>West Devon Jul 85.50</p>
<p>Avon Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Norfolk Jul 83.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to West Norfolk asa 74.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk asa 75.00 Jan/Mar 85.50</p>
<p>Southampton asa 75.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 82.50</p>
</text>
